  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVerify the calculator\u0027s result from part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e by using the formula for the area of a parallelogram.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRecall the formula for the area of a parallelogram.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe formula for the area of a parallelogram is \u003ci\u003eA\u003c/i\u003e \u003d \u003ci\u003ebh\u003c/i\u003e,\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ewhere \u003ci\u003eb\u003c/i\u003e is the base length and \u003ci\u003eh\u003c/i\u003e is the height.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the base length and height in our case.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe length of the segment connecting (0, 2) and (5, 2) is 5. So, for this parallelogram, \u003ci\u003eb\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 4.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe height is the distance between the two bases, or 5 units. So, \u003ci\u003eh\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4c_80/f-80-4b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubstitute.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubstitute in the formula.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003eA\u003c/i\u003e \u003d (5)(5)\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003d 25 square units\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThis verifies the result from part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e(Note: To exit the GEOBOARD application, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20078\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20079\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qquit.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20079\u0026quot;,207)\"\u003e, answer \"Yes\" at the prompt \"Quit this board?\", answer \"No\" at the prompt \"Save this board?\", then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20080\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20080\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20081\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20081\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20082\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20082\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20083\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e to quit.)\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
